  "name": "ShapeNetCar",
  "description": "\n  \n    ShapeNetCar\n  \n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDataset Description\n\t\n\nThe ShapeNetCar dataset comes from the paper Learning Three-dimensional Flow for Interactive Aerodynamic Design by Umetani and Bickel, published in ACM Transactions on Graphics (SIGGRAPH 2018). Based on three-dimensional car geometries from ShapeNet, the dataset uses CFD simulations to obtain velocity fields around the vehicles, surface pressure, and drag coefficients. It supports research on rapidly predicting aerodynamic physical\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/OneScience-Group/ShapeNetCar.",
